DitherPath
==========

Original SoMaCo work. This tree does not vendor source from the two
systems it is designed to sit between.

Dither3D
  https://github.com/somacosf/dither3d
  fork of https://github.com/runevision/Dither3D
  License: Mozilla Public License 2.0
  Surface-stable fractal dither is Rune Skovbo Johansen's invention.
  Occupancy pyramids produced here can drive Dither3D's texture baker.
  Do not copy Dither3DInclude.cginc into this repo.

clearpath
  https://github.com/mrorigo/clearpath
  License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
  Deterministic 2D obstacle-avoidance + cubic Bezier fitting (rustc 1.85).
  DitherPath emits a RouteRequest JSON document that crate can consume.
  The onboard planner here is grid A* + string-pull so the pipeline runs
  on rustc 1.75. It is not a port of clearpath's geometry kernel.

